        <mxCell id="note0" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#d49a20;fontSize=17;" value="Legend: PK = primary key; FK = foreign key; UK = unique key; ? = nullable. Other fields are NOT NULL. Composite keys are grouped, not independent unique fields. Crow-foot links show 1 to 0..many; the stock-row link is 1 to 1. Create each ingredient and its inventory row atomically; a positive initial quantity is written in the same transaction as an ADJUSTMENT movement with reason INITIAL_STOCK. Ingredients are deactivated (active = false), never hard-deleted." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="1710" y="1170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note1" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#fef3c7;strokeColor=#d49a20;fontSize=17;" value="Cross-page references: created_by, updated_by and cancelled_by reference users.id (Support ER). Reservations inherit order membership through FK (order_id, order_item_id). Derived available is not independently updated. Decimal precision and table layout are proposed physical design choices, not mandates of OpenAPI." vertex="1">
